 "remarks": "Experience effortless coastal living in this beautifully maintained townhouse in the highly desirable Shippan Point neighborhood. Set within prestigious Quayside Condominiums, this spacious residence blends comfort, style, and an exceptional waterfront lifestyle.  The inviting living room features a cozy fireplace and flows seamlessly into the dining area, where sliders open to a private patio overlooking beautifully landscaped grounds. The spacious eat-in kitchen offers a breakfast table book adorned with a skylight, granite countertops and a walk-in pantry. Upstairs, the impressive primary suite features vaulted ceilings, two walk-in closets, a private balcony, and an en-suite bath with soaking tub and separate shower. A generously sized second bedroom with walk-in closet, hall bath, and conveniently located laundry complete the second floor.  A spiral staircase leads to a sun-filled loft with skylights-ideal for a home office, guest space, or additional living area. An attached one-car garage and outdoor shed provide abundant storage.  Nestled between Stamford Harbor and West Beach, Quayside offers a peaceful coastal setting just steps from the beach and marina, yet only minutes from downtown Stamford and Metro-North. A rare opportunity to enjoy the best of Shippan Point living!",
